<title>UK: Enterprise, PENNZOIL form alliance.</title>
<headline>Enterprise, PENNZOIL form alliance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enterprises Oil Plc and Pennzoil Co on Thursday said they formed a strategic alliance to pursue certain exploration opportunities on 102 of Pennzoil's leases in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
</text>
